<table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 9, 2003 :: Little of both faction tonight, wrong order!</div><P>SG led us to Kael for some faction gaining fun from our dragon kills. Jakr pulled like someone slipped him the catnip, and in no time flat we had demolished arena and every critter standing including any merchants and spectators! SG grouped us up, some more healing power showed up, so we decided to do Vindi. Two folks were on our normal pulling side, and they were nice enough to offer to help or stand aside or whatever, but we decided to give pulling to the cursed side a shot. You know, maybe warping wouldn't happen this time.. </P>
<P>Yeah, ok, so guess that idea is gone. But luckily we were in massive force and did quite well handling Vindi, both his pesky temple guardians, and two or three adds. Was fun to boot! </P>
<P>Grats Feskan on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/chestplate_of_vindication.jpg">Vindi BP</A>, and some folks got some upgrades in the process, I think Morlith got some plate legs and a bracer, and Dorina got some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/gladiatorschainleggings.jpg">gladiator legs </A>and Zentox on some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/gladiatorschainsleeves.jpg">gladiator arms</A>. and he dropped <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=8607">that necro spell </A>again.. had almost forgotten about it. Vaea's gonna wonder where she got that...</P>
<P>After Vindi, we saw that Klandicar was still up. Seemed a shame to waste all that faction work and let it sit there, so we took the Balut and Tellie express to Western Wastes! Jakr spotted the previously elusive Harla Dar up and got his new swanky back.. or shoulder, and then we did the 'it's too late to make much of a plan.. just charge and keep SG alive, we got the bards!' Grats Vorne on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Klandicar_s_Talisman.jpg">the talisman</A>, Triplet on the Greed roll for some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/reinforced_dragonhide_breastplate.jpg">breastplate</A> that Aridius had gotten last time, Aridius on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/heavydragonhidebreastplate.jpg">minor upgrade </A>to the breastplate he got last time, and Antroe on Greed roll for <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/worked_dragonleg_breeches.jpg">worked dragonleg breeches</A>. Some spells dropped, I forgot to look at them. </P>
<P>Nice work running around bouncing factions tonight :)</P>
<P>Grats Aridius on 61!<BR>Grats Vilesong on 53!<BR>Grats Kreegar on 51 and whatever the hell they call beastlords at 51!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 9, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 7, 2003 :: Grats Baxis!</div><P>On getting your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics14/celestial_fists.JPG">Celestial Fists</A>... which you can't use the clickie effect of... due to minimum level requirements! Bwahahah! </P>
<P><IMG alt="Undead Monk!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/baxisskel.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Wonderous on 64!<BR>Grats Aridius on 60 and Virtuoso!<BR>Grats Sparkley and Thayet on 59!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 57!<BR>Grats Laeaden on 53!<BR>Grats Vilesong on 52!<BR>Grats Baxis on 48!<BR>Grats Wellish and Curtin&nbsp;on 47!<BR>Grats Morlith on 45!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 8, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 7, 2003 :: Vindicator dies again..</div><P>While doing some faction repair work in Kael Arena for the guild, we saw Vindicator up and decided to remedy that! Grats Faileas on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/chestplate_of_vindication.jpg">new breastplate </A>and Kyrt on getting some head! </P>
<P><IMG alt="More damn feet pictures!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vindi.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 8, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 6, 2003 :: Klandicar down again!</div><P>Nice work coming out and owning this dragon yet again! Grats Vaea on the talisman, and to the greed loot winners on his armor drops and guild bank on his spells!</P>
<P><IMG alt="yah yah..old image from Wonderbutt from first fight.." hspace=0 src="http://oregonstate.edu/~powern/images/klandicar.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 8, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 6, 2003 :: Two more epics on Sunday!</div><P>Grats Cerdiwan on your Innoruuk's Curse! I'll add a picture with the cool floaty skulls once Reide or someone with effects on sends me a link or upload or whatever! For now.. Epic Team Harm Touch at CoM! (Sorry Colwn.. models not showing you're sexiness... maybe if you didn't have a bare arm I'd be more inspired!)</P>
<P><IMG alt="Team HT wtih epics!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/teamhtepic.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>Grats Grajin on getting his Earthcaller finally! </P>
<P><IMG alt="Can slow without a shaman bot!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grajin.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Kyrt on 63!<BR>Grats Landry on 61!<BR>Grats Kusari on 50!<BR>Grats Shatta on 48!<BR>Grats Wellish on 46!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Lokki on Oct 6, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 5, 2003 :: Grats Aridius on your epic!!</div><P>Nice to see those musical notes around you!! And grats Cimmy on your new <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics12/Deepwater_Breastplate.JPG">Deepwater Breastplate</A>!</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.capulus.org/aridius.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P><IMG alt="Kick em while he's down!" hspace=0 src="http://www.capulus.org/aridius_epic.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Kleria on 65 and Archon!<BR>Grats Grajin on 65 and Forest Stalker!<BR>Grats Antroe on 65 and Forest Stalker!<BR>Grats Erowyn on 64!<BR>Grats Darkyn on 59!<BR>Grats Lokki on 59!<BR>Grats Vilesong on 51 and Minstrel!<BR>Grats Fahrgus on 50!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 5, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 4, 2003 :: Xanamech takes another dive!</div><P>Nice work all on killing the big metal dragon again, and getting some flags and loots for your guildies! Grats Xditilikish on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/PulsingPhaseEmitter.gif">Pulsing Phase Emitter</A>&nbsp;and Sabrena on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/innovators_ring.jpeg">Innovators Ring</A>!! And thanks Sabrena for passing your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ringoflostsoul.jpg">old ring </A>on to Shatta!! </P>
<P><IMG alt=Splat! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/xanny3.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 5, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 3, 2003 :: Zlandi, Klandi Go Down on Capulus!</div><P>Was an awesome job by all. Keep up the good work ;)</P>
<P>Grats Druentia on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/zlandicars_talisman.jpg">talisman</A> from Zland, Reide on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/zlandicars_heart.JPG">Zlandicar's Heart</A>, Jakr on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4640">Frakadar's Talisman</A> (for <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/quest.html?quest=1220">this quest</A>), and the greed winners for two <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/massive_dragonclaw_shard.jpg">Massive Dragonclaw Shards</A>!</P>
<P><IMG style="WIDTH: 420px; HEIGHT: 300px" height=523 alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.shiningindarkness.com/images/capss/zandi.JPG" width=819 align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>Grats Meeka on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Klandicar_s_Talisman.jpg">Kladicar's talisman</A>, Aridius on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/reinforced_dragonhide_breastplate.jpg">Reinforced Dragonhide Breastplate</A>, and guild bank on some spells. </P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/klandi.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
